{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣領導人賴清德發表「雙十」講話，稱「持續推動國防改革，強化不對稱戰力」，辯稱「增加國防投資，不是為了挑釁，而是為了嚇阻戰爭」。</p><p>國防部新聞發言人陳曦11日就賴清德「雙十」講話答記者問。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T08:58:13.966414+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T08:05:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T10:17:40.946943+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"dd488d3adeb1bc8ee3030c290162ed5b94d37d4d229cb517cea7cbdd450794b0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}